+  WHAT WAS DELIBERATELY CUT, recorded because a later reader will otherwise propose them again:
+  partition expiry and a current/archive split on raw (both UNSAFE under #892 — raw is DAY
+  partitioned on `ingested_at`, so a time expiry deletes by write date and the nine biennial and
